261: \subsection{Full campaign (ready to run)}
262: 
263: Defined parameters: $30\times30$ lattice (900 needles), 8 log-spaced $Q$ values in $[0.05;\,15]$, 5 seeds, 3 geometries $\Rightarrow$ 120 hysteresis runs + 120 relaxation runs. Cost with V39 code: $\sim$2--2.5~min per run ($\approx 7$--8~h serial campaign). \textbf{With V40 optimization} (precomputed dipolar tensor, Section~\ref{sec:improvements}): $\sim$3.3--3.4~s per run $\Rightarrow$ \textbf{$\sim$15~min serial campaign on a single core}, and only a few minutes with \code{--n\_workers} on the \code{jps@mumax} server, with no GPU required.
