\item Run the full campaign on the server (command documented in the scripts; \code{--quick\_test 1} is recommended first to validate the environment);
\item Run the analysis and apply the A/B criterion to $\tau(Q)$ with full statistics; in particular, check whether the slope of $\tau(Q)$ differs between geometries and whether the triangular-domain non-monotonicity survives;
